OL,3,GNEWSA'Quick skin cancer pathway the
OL,4,Abest birthday gift'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man successfully operated on for skin
OL,7,Fcancer just four weeks after he went to
OL,8,Fthe GP to have a mole checked says
OL,9,Fbeing part of a pilot to speed up
OL,10,Ftreatment time was "the best thing
OL,11,Fever".
OL,13,FRichard Alun Jones from Stourbridge had
OL,14,Frecently retired from his position at
OL,15,FJaguar Land Rover when his partner
OL,16,Fnoticed changes to a mole on his back.
OL,18,FHe had the operation to remove it as
OL,19,Fpart of a new nurse-led pathway at
OL,20,FDudley's Russells Hall Hospital on his
OL,21,F61st birthday last August and was later
OL,22,Ftold it was melanoma.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
